OL,3,CBail approved for law student charged
OL,4,Cover intercepted bomb
OL,6,FA law student charged in relation to a
OL,7,Fbomb intercepted in a car near the
OL,8,FIrish border has been granted bail
OL,9,Fafter a judge accepted she had met the
OL,10,Fconditions required for her to be
OL,11,Freleased from custody.
OL,13,FIsobella Perrie Sullivan, 25, of
OL,14,FAbbeylands Park, Clane, Co Kildare,
OL,15,Fwas charged with possession of
OL,16,Fexplosives at a special sitting of
OL,17,FTrim District Court in Co Meath on
OL,18,FFriday.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/6
