OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F411A1785253711
OL,3,CBail approved for law student charged
OL,4,Cover intercepted bomb
OL,6,FAt that hearing, her defence solicitor
OL,7,Fsaid she had been asked to take a bag
OL,8,Fto the north and had not been aware
OL,9,Fwhat was in it, adding that she had
OL,10,Fbeen "manipulated".
OL,12,FThe car was stopped on the N2 at
OL,13,FAclint, Carrickmacross, Co Monaghan,
OL,14,Flast Wednesday.
OL,16,FDuring a search of the vehicle, a bag
OL,17,Fwas discovered in the rear seat that
OL,18,Fcontained an amount of Semtex military
OL,19,Fgrade explosive and a detonator.
OL,26,@rD@FOUrD@RO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/6
