OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F411A1785253711
OL,3,CBail approved for law student charged
OL,4,Cover intercepted bomb
OL,6,FIn court on Friday, Ms Perrie Sullivan
OL,7,Fwas granted bail with a host of
OL,8,Fconditions, which included a 15,000-
OL,9,Feuro independent surety, that she
OL,10,Fsurrendered her passport, stays at an
OL,11,Faddress approved by gardai with a
OL,12,Fcurfew of 9pm to 7am, has a mobile
OL,13,Fphone available 24 hours a day and
OL,14,Fsigns in each day to Naas garda
OL,15,Fstation.
OL,17,FGardai also requested another
OL,18,Fcondition, that she not have any
OL,19,Fcontact with anyone in Saoradh or the
OL,20,FNew IRA.
OL,26,@sD@ZrtyD@Frt
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/6
