OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F411A1785253711
OL,3,CBail approved for law student charged
OL,4,Cover intercepted bomb
OL,6,FShe was remanded in custody pending
OL,7,Fconfirmation that she had met the
OL,8,Fconditions required for her to be
OL,9,Fbailed.
OL,11,FShe was further remanded on Monday at
OL,12,Fa hearing at Monaghan District Court
OL,13,Fafter Judge Raymond Finnegan said that
OL,14,Fhe had not yet received an application
OL,15,Fto approve the surety.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/6
