OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F411A1785253711
OL,3,CBail approved for law student charged
OL,4,Cover intercepted bomb
OL,6,FIn Cavan District Court on Tuesday,
OL,7,FJudge Finnegan granted the bail
OL,8,Fapplication after it was confirmed the
OL,9,Fsurety had been provided by an
OL,10,Findividual with an address in the
OL,11,FClaremorris area of Co Mayo.
OL,13,FBarrister Sara Brennan represented Ms
OL,14,FPerrie Sullivan, who was not present
OL,15,Fin court.
OL,17,FThe accused will next appear before
OL,18,FMonaghan District Court on August 7.
